The error comes from the word "input" in two PARAMS comments, which the checker flags as a forbidden construct. I reworded them and left the topology unchanged: a 6-transistor Schmitt core with feedback devices, followed by an inverter that restores the output levels. I also raised the initial core L to 3 µm to cut crowbar current against the 8.1 µW budget.

